This bad smell helps us identify garbage from other things, as it is a sensory cue that alerts us to the presence of waste products which can often be harmful and unsanitary. Whereas the other options, such as "folkest", "container", "can smell nasty", and "composted" are either not descriptive enough or do not universally signify garbage in all cases.
